# weaver of ipl_gpacks (weaving), its own open: meta o opens the dialog, focus returns the input focus to the pointer (the program pins it to its
# interface window with Raise), the fixture twill.pfd (a 4-shaft twill) is named and Return opens it. As shipped the program cannot open any
# draft: the oracle ends at the open with a run-time error (the cto's ruling 2026-11-16 14:47 CST: graded on that error, want_rc 1, stderr merged).
move 100 60
keydown Alt_L
key o
keyup Alt_L
wait
move 200 88
focus
type twill.pfd
key Return
